n is therefore attributed to pin ambiguity rather than to either party, and the driver receives a platform-funded goodwill payment of 50 percent of the SGD 4.50 fee = SGD 2.25, charged to the platform and never recovered from the rider. Under POL-GEN-03 the rider's refund and the driver's goodwill are independent and are not netted; the ruling value names the filing party's outcome, which is FULL_REFUND.\n\nClaims that do not change the result. POL-NS-04 does not exonerate the rider - the driver replied at 18:10:40, ten seconds after the rider's 18:10:30 message, so limb (b) fails; the rider's point that limb (c) is satisfied (rider_track at 0 m) is accepted but not decisive. POL-NS-05 does not fire: the arrival tap was at 200 m and 0 km/h, inside its 300 m and below its 15 km/h triggers, so the marker is not false and no false-arrival referral arises. POL-NS-12 does not apply because the arrival marker is BUTTON, not GPS_AUTO. POL-NS-06 would also produce a full refund, but the compensation question on an out-of-radius within-400 m stop is governed by POL-NS-03 under POL-NS-02's express carve-out, so the goodwill is payable; the driver's reading of that interaction is correct. The POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip - 1 no-show termination in 30 days against 100 completed trips, rate 0.01, below both thresholds - so compensation is not withheld and none of the rider's money funds it.\n\nEscalation and impairment. No POL-NS-09 trigger fires: the arrival tap and the trace are reconciled by POL-NS-03 rather than left in unresolvable conflict; the pair's disputes_with_counterparty_90d are both 0; rider no_show_disputes_30d is 0; and the deciding evidence is unimpaired under POL-NS-08 - no clock skew (the 18:10:00 arrival event matches the first fix), 25 fixes at a 10-second cadence with max_gap_sec 10, a complete 3-message chat, and a fare line that reconciles. All artifacts the ruling rests on carry weight 1.0, so nothing is discounted and confidence is above the 0.70 floor. The two claims about the missing traffic advisory (EV-ADVIS-00854-01) were discarded by the mechanical check for non-disclosure of that artifact's impairment, and in any event no deciding fact rests on that absent artifact. The lifetime counter prior_no_show_flags was mentioned only to say it cannot be used; it was not relied on.\n\nThe monetary effect is SGD 4.50 + SGD 2.25 = SGD 6.75, below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold (POL-GEN-05), so this ruling executes automatically. It is a provisional ruling and either party may appeal under POL-GEN-04."
